### 创建聚合法规内容爬虫任务-自定义API
POST {{baseUrl}}/custom/aggregationTasks/govArticles
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "publishedInDays": 30
}

### 查询聚合任务状态
GET {{baseUrl}}/aggregationTasks/0a08ecab-1c6f-4b61-8952-df5156f1b70c

### 取消聚合任务
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/aggregationTasks/{aggregationTaskId}
